WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.343
Bobby and his teenage cousin walked into the farmyard.

2
00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:08.858
"See you later, Drew," Bobby said.

3
00:00:08.859 --> 00:00:14.049
Drew grinned. "Be ready for Big Splashdown!"

4
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:19.126
Bobby looked nervous as he waved good-bye.

5
00:00:19.127 --> 00:00:23.756
"What's Big Splashdown?" Nina asked.

6
00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:29.203
"My cousin is taking me to a waterpark this afternoon," Bobby said.

7
00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:32.469
"But we won't go if it rains."

8
00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:35.871
Everyone looked at the blue sky.

9
00:00:35.872 --> 00:00:40.823
"There's not a cloud anywhere!" Izzie said.

10
00:00:40.824 --> 00:00:43.899
"The weather changes fast sometimes.

11
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:50.812
It could rain," Bobby said.

12
00:00:50.813 --> 00:00:55.101
The kids went inside and washed their hands.

13
00:00:55.102 --> 00:00:58.851
A basket of blueberries sat on the counter.

14
00:00:58.852 --> 00:01:04.274
Chef pointed to the screen. "Here's today's recipe."

15
00:01:04.275 --> 00:01:11.839
Nina smiled. "Yum! Lemon blueberry muffins."

16
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.206
Jason put on his apron.

17
00:01:14.207 --> 00:01:19.951
"Bobby, you don't sound too excited about the waterpark."

18
00:01:19.952 --> 00:01:26.053
Bobby frowned. "Drew wants to go down Mount Olympus waterslide.

19
00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:30.101
It's the highest slide in the park."

20
00:01:30.102 --> 00:01:34.593
"Don't go down the slide if you're scared," Izzie said.

21
00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:39.841
"If I don't, Drew will tease me," Bobby said.

22
00:01:39.842 --> 00:01:50.217
"Izzie, please preheat the oven to 190 degrees Celsius," Chef said.

23
00:01:50.218 --> 00:01:58.061
"I'll line the muffin cups," Nina said.

24
00:01:58.062 --> 00:02:04.072
She looked at the recipe. "What is zest?"

25
00:02:04.073 --> 00:02:08.885
"It's finely grated peel from citrus fruit," Chef said.

26
00:02:08.886 --> 00:02:14.602
"It adds an intense flavor. Bobby can zest the lemon."

27
00:02:14.603 --> 00:02:18.396
Chef showed him how to scrape the lemon against the grater.

28
00:02:18.397 --> 00:02:20.734
"Don't scrape the white part.

29
00:02:20.735 --> 00:02:25.808
It tastes bitter. Just scrape the yellow part."

30
00:02:25.809 --> 00:02:28.507
Bobby tried to do a good job.

31
00:02:28.508 --> 00:02:32.209
"Hey, Chef!" He suddenly had an idea.

32
00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:36.170
"I can stay after class if you need extra help!"

33
00:02:36.171 --> 00:02:39.040
"That's not necessary," Chef said.

34
00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:45.297
Bobby looked disappointed.

35
00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:49.807
Using the mixer, Jason combined the butter and sugar.

36
00:02:49.808 --> 00:02:52.917
Bobby added the lemon zest.

37
00:02:52.918 --> 00:02:56.826
Then Nina and Izzie added the egg and vanilla.

38
00:02:56.827 --> 00:03:01.556
Jason mixed everything together.

39
00:03:01.557 --> 00:03:06.552
"Now we combine these dry ingredients," Izzie said.

40
00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:10.868
Bobby measured two cups of flour and poured it into a bowl.

41
00:03:10.869 --> 00:03:14.110
Izzie sprinkled in a teaspoon of salt.

42
00:03:14.111 --> 00:03:20.442
Jason added two teaspoons of baking powder and whisked the ingredients together.

43
00:03:20.443 --> 00:03:26.290
"Next we add these dry ingredients to the butter mixture," Izzie said.

44
00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:31.552
"Yep. And then we add the milk," Nina said.

45
00:03:31.553 --> 00:03:34.514
Bobby added the dry ingredients.

46
00:03:34.515 --> 00:03:37.439
Nina added the milk.

47
00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:41.694
Jason mixed until the batter was thick.

48
00:03:41.695 --> 00:03:46.386
"I'll fold in the blueberries," Izzie said.

49
00:03:46.387 --> 00:03:51.043
She poured in the berries and gently stirred.

50
00:03:51.044 --> 00:03:57.635
The kids took turns filling the muffin cups with batter.

51
00:03:57.636 --> 00:04:01.791
Chef put the pan into the oven.

52
00:04:01.792 --> 00:04:05.948
Nina and Izzie went outside to feed the chickens.

53
00:04:05.949 --> 00:04:11.433
Bobby washed dishes, and Jason wiped the counters.

54
00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:15.820
"It's okay to be scared of the waterslide, Bobby," Jason said.

55
00:04:15.821 --> 00:04:19.546
"I bet your cousin is afraid of something too."

56
00:04:19.547 --> 00:04:22.277
Bobby thought for a minute.

57
00:04:22.278 --> 00:04:26.050
"Drew is afraid to talk to girls!"

58
00:04:26.051 --> 00:04:36.244
He and Jason laughed.

59
00:04:36.245 --> 00:04:40.315
The girls came inside when the muffins were ready.

60
00:04:40.316 --> 00:04:43.745
Bobby bit into a warm, delicious muffin.

61
00:04:43.746 --> 00:04:48.398
"Maybe I'll go down the waterslide, but maybe not."

62
00:04:48.399 --> 00:04:52.203
"What if Drew teases you?" Jason asked.

63
00:04:52.204 --> 00:04:59.015
Bobby grinned. "I'll just find a teenage girl and talk to her.

64
00:04:59.016 --> 00:05:02.405
That will keep Drew quiet!"

65
00:05:02.406 --> 00:05:09.267
Bobby and Jason bumped fists and chuckled.

